{"sections":[{"slug":"Möbius函数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Möbius函数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Möbius 函数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span> $\\mu\\colon \\mathbb{N}_+ \\to\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定义为</span>\n$$\r\n\\mu(n) = \\begin{cases}\r\n    0 &amp; n \\text{ 有平方因子}\\\\\r\n    (-1)^r &amp; n=p_1\\cdots p_r\\text{ 为不同素数的乘积}.\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, $\\mu(1)=1$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span> $\\mu$ <span lang=\"zh\">与常值函数</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Dirichlet卷积","text":"Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">卷积的单位元</span>):\n$$\r\n\\sum_{i|n}\\mu(i)=\\begin{cases}\r\n    1 &amp; n=1\\\\\r\n    0 &amp; n&gt;1\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个性质导致了</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Möbius反演","text":"Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">反演</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}